    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that \"honesty\" just makes everything worse. it's not just about being sad, it's the shame. i can't even imagine looking them in the eye and telling them i failed. it feels like the only thing that would make sense is to just... not be here. to preserve the way they remember me, instead of them having to watch me slowly fail at everything for the next ten years. it feels like the only way to stop being a burden is to just disappear.",
